 "description": "Assign an existing Project To-do. audience is mandatory; SELECTED requires exact selectedContractIds and never includes future hires. Broad audiences and provider-owned setup assignments require a matching signed preflight receipt. Provider-owned results distinguish first-time invites, re-invites after close, preserved unfinished work, and preserved resolved work; retries converge. Requires project_todos:write.",
